;    1: TDecorate(count=1374, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ききょう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=38, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=かな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=は, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1549, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1418, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Saien<STYLE ID="1">. Do you know the word?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sai means learning and talent; en is a term of praise for a woman.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, saien is the word for a woman of high learning and talent.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Sadly, however, depending on the era and its ideology, even the existence of a saien may go unknown.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shiyo 678, further back still from the present day of Shiyo 800.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In society at large in those days, male dominance ran deep, and there were times when it was held that those who made their mark on the world must always be men, and that women must be the ones who supported those men from the shadows.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If, in an age of male dominance, there had been a woman called a saien.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Perhaps the world would have changed once again, greatly, or even just a little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Indeed, it is not known that there was a woman who changed the world in small ways, and in great ones.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Though she was blessed with a rare talent, because of the era and its ideology, that talent never became known to the world.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is, to the world on the surface―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\流るる時.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\黒船.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Long, long ago, ships from the West came from far across the sea.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The time had come for this country, too, to truly mingle with the civilization of the Great Powers, but it still fell far short of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Before long, though, this country too would gain the strength to stand alongside the West.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To that end, we would have to learn a great deal about the West, starting now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So I thought.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\桔梗実家.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doing that sort of thing again...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As I was devouring Father's books, those words suddenly came my way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Father, where would the next volume of this book be?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Reading books and devoting oneself to study were what men did.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because of that prevailing attitude, Father frowned on my reading.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rather than such things, he wanted me to acquire the refinement of a woman and become a woman who walked one step behind a man.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Father always said so, but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Here. This one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thank you, Father!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Perhaps Father had given up by now, because he had started to turn a blind eye to my reading.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Because you're a man. Because you're a woman.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Anyone who says nothing but such outdated things will only be swallowed by the wave of civilization that is coming.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even when the new age comes, I will ride that wave and live on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And for that, I must acquire learning, starting now.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\街並みセピア.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">And so I was a clever woman of some fame in these parts.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the abacus I lost to none of the men around, and in a debate I could even crush my opponent with logic rather than with emotional appeals.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that reputation, I was a girl genius of some fame in these parts.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From where Father stood, he surely did not think well of me as I was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I understood Father's side of it, but unfortunately my interest and my passion would not turn in that direction.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">―It was then that I met a certain gentleman.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\荷車.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\街並み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">At the time, I was watching from out of sight as a cart carried unknown goods brought from the West.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No doubt they were being taken to the Emperor's castle, to be presented there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To begin with, the gap in strength between Japan and the West was plain to see.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Those gifts being presented were less a show of respect for the Emperor than a display of the Great Powers' strength.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Inside were unknown goods I knew nothing about.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I would surely never </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="かな">get</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to hold them in my hands, but just </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="は">sending</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> my dreams across the sea like this was enough to make my heart race.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Let me say this so there is no misunderstanding: I am not dreaming of crossing the sea myself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If those things were absorbed into Japan and fused with it, how much richer would this country become?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What I dream of is this country in its prosperity.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, excuse me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Suddenly, a gentleman's voice came from behind me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Perhaps because I had been so absorbed in the cart, I had not sensed anyone there at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I turned around, and―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\surprising_shock1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶらバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―!!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There stood one man, clad in a Noh mask and a red cloth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At that bizarre sight, I covered my mouth.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------